{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちはーー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐藤詩織です!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人セゾン、沢山の方の手元にあるみたいで、\nまだまだ沢山の方に聴いていただいてるみたいで、\n本当に有難い限りです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難うございます(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、お仕事がなかった日に、\n渋谷と原宿と表参道を通ったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人セゾ〜〜ン 二人セゾ〜〜ン\n春夏で〜 恋をして〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って聴き覚えのある曲が聴こえてきて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良い歌だな〜って思いながら振り返ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"KEYABINGO!のラッピングトレーラーが!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"液晶画面で映像まで映し出されていて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おもわず、止まって、通り過ぎるまで見てしまった。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくれた方いるかな〜?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、二人セゾンを色々なところで耳にすることがあって嬉しい!\nすきだな〜〜って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きといえば、このふたり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2QD6SFYZJCMM7X9C2NESW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2QF3VAN9XXK66VTPETHFX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"KEYAROOMでは、スタッフさんに無理言ってお願いして、初の2人にお手紙書かせていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふたりには、本当に辛いときにいつも助けられてるな〜って手紙書きながら再認識。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと大切にしていく存在です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、ふゆしセゾンで、お出かけいくぞ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てなわけで!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、スキマスイッチさんにハマってよく聴いてます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詩織**"}],"source":"archive"}